"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 50.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.29"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":204.12,"default_fair_val":204.12,"premium_pct":-69.3,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":34.3,"pe_forward":30.2,"pb_trailing":4.1,"pb_forward":3.7,"div_yield":1.43,"ps_ratio":2.3,"fcf_to_ev":3.01,"fcf_to_mcap":10.65,"liab_to_assets":50.6,"cash_to_assets":4.2,"current_ratio":1.29,"roe":11.9,"roa":4.1,"moat":{"ticker":"RPRX","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的品牌定價權相對有限，其收入主要來自於對現有藥物專利權的投資，而非直接銷售產品。雖然其投資組合包含一些知名藥物，但其定價能力受限於藥物本身的市場接受度、競爭藥物的出現以及藥品監管政策。公司無法像傳統製藥公司那樣透過品牌行銷和產品差異化來主導定價，其收入更多是基於合約條款和藥物生命週期。因此，在品牌定價權方面，其護城河屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's brand pricing power is relatively limited. Its revenue primarily stems from investments in existing drug patent rights rather than direct product sales. While its portfolio includes some well-known drugs, its pricing ability is constrained by the drug's market acceptance, the emergence of competing drugs, and pharmaceutical regulatory policies. The company cannot dictate pricing through brand marketing and product differentiation like traditional pharmaceutical firms; its revenue is more based on contractual terms and the drug lifecycle. Therefore, its moat in terms of brand pricing power is moderate."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的核心護城河建立在對藥物專利權的投資上。透過購買或投資於具有長期專利保護的藥物，公司能從這些受法律保護的資產中獲取穩定的現金流。這種模式使其能夠受益於製藥行業嚴格的專利和監管體系，為其收入提供了一定的可見性和穩定性。然而，專利到期和新藥研發的持續挑戰意味著公司需要不斷尋找新的投資標的來維持其護城河的強度。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's core moat is built upon its investments in drug patent rights. By acquiring or investing in drugs with long-term patent protection, the company secures stable cash flows from these legally protected assets. This model allows it to benefit from the stringent patent and regulatory system in the pharmaceutical industry, providing a degree of visibility and stability to its revenue. However, patent expirations and the continuous challenge of new drug development mean the company must constantly seek new investment targets to maintain the strength of its moat."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式並非直接面向終端消費者或醫療機構，因此其客戶（通常是藥品開發商或持有專利權的公司）的轉換成本相對較低。一旦合約到期或出現更具吸引力的融資夥伴，藥品開發商可能轉向其他融資管道。公司缺乏傳統企業中常見的用戶黏性或高轉換成本壁壘，這限制了其在此維度的護城河強度。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model does not directly engage end consumers or healthcare providers. Consequently, the switching costs for its clients (typically drug developers or patent-holding companies) are relatively low. Once a contract expires or a more attractive financing partner emerges, drug developers may seek alternative funding channels. The company lacks the customer stickiness or high switching cost barriers common in traditional businesses, which limits its moat strength in this dimension."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式不涉及顯著的網絡效應。其收入來源於對特定藥物專利的投資回報，而非依賴用戶數量增長帶來的價值提升。公司與藥品開發商的合作關係是基於交易的，而非形成一個不斷擴大的網絡來鞏固其市場地位。因此，網絡效應幾乎不構成其護城河的一部分。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model does not involve significant network effects. Its revenue is derived from the return on investment in specific drug patents, rather than relying on value enhancement through user growth. The company's partnerships with drug developers are transactional rather than forming an expanding network to solidify its market position. Therefore, network effects constitute almost no part of its moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 作為最大的藥物特許權投資公司之一，其規模帶來了一定的成本優勢。公司能夠透過其龐大的資產規模和專業知識，在交易中獲得更有利的條款，並能承擔更大規模的投資。這種規模使其在與藥品開發商談判時具有一定的議價能力，並能分散投資風險。然而，相較於傳統製藥巨頭的生產和研發規模經濟，其成本優勢相對有限。","comment_en":"As one of the largest investors in drug royalties, Royalty Pharma benefits from certain cost advantages due to its scale. Its substantial asset base and specialized expertise allow it to secure more favorable terms in transactions and undertake larger investments. This scale provides some bargaining power when negotiating with drug developers and enables risk diversification. However, compared to the economies of scale in production and R&D of traditional pharmaceutical giants, its cost advantage is relatively limited."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務主要集中在對全球藥物專利的投資，其資產的獨特性體現在對特定藥物現金流的權利，而非地理位置上的優勢。公司在全球範圍內尋找投資機會，但其護城河並非來自於獨特的地理位置或資源，而是來自於對藥物專利權的精準評估和投資能力。因此，在此維度上，其護城河較弱。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business primarily focuses on investing in global drug patents. The uniqueness of its assets lies in its rights to specific drug cash flows, rather than geographical advantages. While the company seeks investment opportunities worldwide, its moat does not stem from unique locations or resources but from its precise assessment and investment capabilities in drug patent rights. Therefore, its moat in this dimension is weak."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 在其專業領域內展現了高度的營運效率。公司專注於藥物專利權的投資和管理，透過精準的盡職調查、嚴謹的財務模型和有效的合約管理，確保其投資組合的穩定性和回報。其專門的團隊能夠識別和評估具有潛力的藥物現金流，並有效管理與藥品開發商的關係。這種高度專業化的營運模式是其重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma demonstrates high operational efficiency within its specialized field. The company focuses on investing in and managing drug patent rights, ensuring the stability and returns of its investment portfolio through precise due diligence, rigorous financial modeling, and effective contract management. Its dedicated team can identify and evaluate potential drug cash flows and effectively manage relationships with drug developers. This highly specialized operational model is a significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的資本配置策略是其核心競爭力之一。公司專注於將資本投入到具有長期專利保護、現金流穩定且能產生可觀回報的藥物專利權上。其管理層在識別、評估和執行這些複雜交易方面經驗豐富，並能有效平衡風險與回報。公司透過精準的投資決策，持續為股東創造價值，體現了卓越的資本配置能力。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's capital allocation strategy is one of its core competencies. The company focuses on deploying capital into drug patent rights that have long-term patent protection, stable cash flows, and the potential for significant returns. Its management team is experienced in identifying, evaluating, and executing these complex transactions, effectively balancing risk and reward. Through precise investment decisions, the company consistently creates value for shareholders, demonstrating excellent capital allocation capabilities."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的客戶（藥品開發商）的留存率並非其主要的護城河來源。雖然公司與其合作夥伴建立長期關係，但這種關係更多是基於交易的成功與否以及雙方的持續需求。一旦藥品開發商有其他融資選擇或Royalty Pharma 的投資條件不再具吸引力，客戶轉換的可能性依然存在。因此，客戶留存在此業務模式下的重要性相對較低。","comment_en":"The retention rate of Royalty Pharma's clients (drug developers) is not its primary source of moat. While the company builds long-term relationships with its partners, these relationships are more based on the success of transactions and mutual ongoing needs. If drug developers have other financing options or if Royalty Pharma's investment terms are no longer attractive, the possibility of client switching remains. Therefore, customer retention is of relatively low importance in this business model."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式具有相當的持久性，主要依賴於對已獲專利保護的藥物現金流的投資。只要這些藥物能夠持續銷售並產生現金流，且專利權有效，公司的收入就能保持穩定。這種模式使其能夠在一定程度上抵禦市場波動和短期經濟衰退。然而，其持久性也受到新藥研發進展、專利懸崖以及醫療保健政策變化的影響。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model possesses considerable durability, primarily relying on investments in cash flows from patented drugs. As long as these drugs continue to be sold and generate cash flow, and the patents remain valid, the company's revenue can remain stable. This model allows it to withstand market fluctuations and short-term economic downturns to some extent. However, its durability is also influenced by new drug development progress, patent cliffs, and changes in healthcare policies."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的護城河主要建立在其對藥物專利權的投資能力上，這是一種基於特許經營權的模式，但與傳統的收費橋或品牌型企業不同。其核心優勢在於對複雜藥物專利和現金流的精準評估能力，以及透過規模化運營獲得的成本和談判優勢。然而，其護城河相對較弱的環節包括網絡效應和客戶轉換成本，這意味著公司需要持續透過卓越的資本配置和營運效率來維持其競爭優勢，以應對專利到期和行業變革的挑戰。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Royalty Pharma's moat is primarily built on its ability to invest in drug patent rights, a model akin to a 'toll bridge' or 'franchise' but distinct from traditional forms. Its core strength lies in its precise assessment of complex drug patents and cash flows, coupled with cost and negotiation advantages derived from scaled operations. However, weaker aspects of its moat include network effects and customer switching costs, implying the company must continuously leverage exceptional capital allocation and operational efficiency to maintain its competitive edge against challenges like patent expirations and industry evolution.","evidenceHash":"238cb744751e6ab97d26a41fb036fb837768f648fe19a5b7de42adddf22104dc","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"8456cff60f6cce1b428e1177733fe9c5f37d65523555c8f9b254f4ef79c5fb1d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":null,"reason":"incompleteCriteria","scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"8456cff60f6cce1b428e1177733fe9c5f37d65523555c8f9b254f4ef79c5fb1d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RPRX.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RPRX.png","website":"https://www.royaltypharma.com","ceo":"Pablo Legorreta","full_time_employees":"100","description":"Royalty Pharma plc operates as a buyer of biopharmaceutical royalties and a funder of innovation in the biopharmaceutical industry in the United States. Its portfolio consists of royalties on approximately 35 marketed therapies and 20 development-stage product candidates that address various therapeutic areas, such as rare disease, oncology, neuroscience, infectious disease, hematology, and diabetes. The company was founded in 1996 and is based in New York, New York.","description_en":"Royalty Pharma plc operates as a buyer of biopharmaceutical royalties and a funder of innovation in the biopharmaceutical industry in the United States. Its portfolio consists of royalties on approximately 35 marketed therapies and 20 development-stage product candidates that address various therapeutic areas, such as rare disease, oncology, neuroscience, infectious disease, hematology, and diabetes. The company was founded in 1996 and is based in New York, New York.","description_zh":"Royalty Pharma plc (RPRX) 是一家專注於美國生技製藥產業的企業，其核心業務模式為收購生技製藥權利金（royalties）並為產業創新提供資金。\n\n公司投資組合涵蓋約 35 項已上市療法及 20 項開發階段的產品候選物，這些產品廣泛應用於多種治療領域，包括罕見疾病、腫瘤學、神經科學、傳染病、血液學及糖尿病等。透過購買現有藥物或開發中藥物的未來權利金收益，Royalty Pharma 能夠獲得穩定的現金流，同時也為生技製藥公司提供關鍵的研發資金，加速新藥的開發與上市進程。此營運模式使公司能參與到具潛力的新藥開發，並從中獲取長期收益。","address":"110 East 59th Street","city":"New York","state":"NY","zip":"10022","country":"US","phone":"212 883 0200","full_address":"110 East 59th Street, New York, NY 10022, US","range_52w":"35.915-64.38","year_high":64.38,"year_low":35.915,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":35.915,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date